{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In &quot;Descent Into Darkness&quot;</strong>, you must take an elevator down into the depths of a mysterious underground complex, filled with dangers and secrets. Your goal is to find a way out\u2014but with each level, the darkness grows, and the threats become more terrifying...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Endless Descent \u2013 Explore procedurally generated levels, unlock new zones, and search for an escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Singleplayer &amp; Online Co-op \u2013 Survive alone or descend with friends (if you dare).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Dark Atmosphere \u2013 Eerie visuals and immersive sound design pull you into the horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 First-Person &amp; Third-Person \u2013 Switch perspectives for the ultimate immersive horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Unspeakable Horrors \u2013 What watches you from the darkness? Don't look back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you escape the abyss?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534750?t=1757046113","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534750?t=1757046113","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534750/990373922149c6dced3de9c056006f0b7ecac2b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757046113","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534750/990373922149c6dced3de9c056006f0b7ecac2b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757046113","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In &qu